-/*
- * Apple Silicon JPEG mem2mem scaffold. No hardware jobs are implemented.
- * Register offset provenance: Asahi Linux m1n1 (MIT), commit
- * f3ac615eb1376d3bbba24cd84c414b9e41892adb, proxyclient/m1n1/hw/jpeg.py.
- */
